{"translation":{"id":"cmn_feb","name":"免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"FEB","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: 免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"281f45e9c6d64d9cf8e618e4fd7d2d961bebba0f46a534312de0f8ea52a83755","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7959,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_feb","name":"哥林多前书","commonName":"哥林多前书","title":"哥林多前书","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"ee0ec9ce4402903f9e0caedffe0a210e2eabf7fe403d3afa54b6d58715316a6a","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["如果我能熟练讲述这世间甚至是天使的语言，但没有爱，我的语言也不过就像发出回响的锣，或者发出碰撞声的钹。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["如果我可以说出预言，知晓所有奥秘和所有的知识，拥有可以移动山峦的信心，但没有爱，我就一无是处。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我若把自己拥有的一切分给穷困之人，或如被焚烧的殉道者舍弃自己的生命，但没有爱，我什么也得不到。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["爱是耐心和善良。爱是不嫉妒、不吹嘘、不傲慢。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["爱是不做错误之举，不会固守自己的方式。爱是不会轻易动怒，对他人的过错不记仇。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["爱不会因罪恶而喜悦，只喜欢真理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["爱是不放弃，是坚守信念，是保持信心，是时刻保持耐心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["爱永生不息。预言终会结束，语言终将沉默，知识最终也会失去它的用途。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我们对知识和语言的理解非常片面。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["等结束终将来临，这片面的理解也将消失。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["如果是孩子，其说话、思想和反应就要像个孩子。但孩子长大后，就要丢弃一切孩子气的行为。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["此刻我们就像窥视以免镜子模糊的反光，但很快，我们就要彼此相见了。我现在所知仅为一部分，到时候就会知晓一切，好像完全知道我一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["信任、希望和爱将永续存在，但最重要的仍然是爱。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1CO/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1CO/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1CO/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}